# Laravel Boost

- AGENTS.md contains the repository's framework conventions. Refer to it once per task.
- Prefer Boost's available Application Info and Search Docs tools when the installed API or idiomatic feature choice is uncertain. Batch closely related queries and limit results to the package and version in use.
- Read the relevant match and implement. Repeat research only for a new uncertainty.
- Use schema, route, recent log, and error tools for a concrete question. Favor read-only inspection.
- If a needed tool is unavailable, use installed source or official documentation for the verified version. Report a material gap once and continue the independent work.
- The reviewed lockfile has Laravel 13, Livewire 4, PHPUnit 12, and Boost 2. These are a snapshot, so verify relevant installed versions after dependency changes.
- Preserve customized execution policies when regenerating Boost guidance. Review generated diffs for stale versions and conflicting test instructions.
